      "label": "Maritime Governed Record",
      "description": "Root data cluster (DMType Item) for a governed maritime-port record in CordovaOS: a vessel call and its cargo manifest. Wraps the domain's data components with the shared W3C PROV-O Provenance cluster so each record carries its lineage bound alongside its data. Workflow, attestation, parties, and the system audit trail sit in the DMType's native governance slots; access control and retention apply as bound sdcgovernance policy.",
